: {"version": "1.0", "status": "Correlation-based screening", "method": "IEC 60534-2-1 FL vena-contracta / choked dP; sigma = (P1 - Pv)/(P1 - P2) vs valve-specific limits; IAPWS-IF97 Pv", "validation": "Verified against IF97 verification values and hand calculation; not CFD", "doc": "CHOKE_CAVITATION_MODEL.md"}, "api14e": {"version": "1.0", "status": "Correlation-based screening", "method": "API RP 14E erosional velocity Ve = C / sqrt(rho_m), supplementary", "validation": "Hand evaluation; not a sand-erosion or choke model", "doc": "CHOKE_EROSION_MODEL.md"}}, "assumptions": ["Multiphase: Generic black-oil correlations - not fitted to a laboratory PVT report.", "Multiphase: Phase behaviour and holdup are quasi-steady: slugging, terrain slugging and phase-slip transients are NOT simulated.", "Multiphase: Gas solubility in water and oil-water emulsion viscosity are neglected.", "Multiphase: The dynamic radial reservoir model is single-phase: inflow below the bubble point is flagged.", "Sand / erosion: Sanding onset: TWC-based critical drawdown for perforations (worst orientation); rock strength and stresses must be site data.", "Sand / erosion: Post-onset sand rate is EMPIRICAL and must be calibrated - no universal equation exists.", "Sand / erosion: Trim erosion: DNV-RP-O501-type particle erosion with a generic geometry; trim-specific accuracy requires calibration by inspection (or vendor / CFD data).", "Sand / erosion: Particle velocity = jet velocity at the vena contracta; small particles that follow the flow are treated conservatively (no size reduction).", "Sand / erosion: Body / gallery wear is a screening estimate; erosion-corrosion, cavitation and hydrate / scale effects are not modelled.", "Sand / erosion: Sand settling / deposition in the flowline is flagged (screening velocity) but not simulated.", "Cavitation: ASSUMED bubble-point uncertainty band +/-10 % for the Standing correlation"], "uncertainty": {"mpfm_uncertainty_pct": {"oil_sm3_d": 6.061628140540602